# Solar Majesty roadmap

Living plan: `Docs/Roadmap/`. Work **one phase at a time**. Current work is **Phase 1** (`02_PHASE_1_CAMPAIGN_QUALITY_DEMO.md`). Phase 0 is locked.

## Non-negotiables
- Never add click-to-move or any player command that bypasses `SpecialistBrain`.
- Pure C# only under `Assets/Scripts/Systems/`. Runtime/MonoBehaviours under `Runtime/`.
- Namespace `SolarMajesty`. Data-driven ScriptableObjects for numbers and affinities.
- New art uses locked Grok Imagine style keywords (see Phase 0).
- Do not rewrite `SpecialistBrain` scoring without explicit design sign-off.

## Phase order
0 Foundation lock (complete) → 1 Campaign-quality demo → 2 Solar expansion → 3 Content explosion → 4 Ship polish.
